  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Controls the theme of OS-drawn status bar content (icons, text) on mobile platforms (Android, iOS).
            Analogous to <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.ApplicationModel.AppTheme" /> — <see cref="F:Microsoft.Maui.StatusBarTheme.Light" /> means light background
            with dark icons, <see cref="F:Microsoft.Maui.StatusBarTheme.Dark" /> means dark background with light icons.
            On desktop platforms (Windows, macCatalyst) this is a no-op since there are no OS-drawn status bar icons.
            </summary>
    <remarks>To be added.</remarks>
  </Docs>
